Soo-saar qor: ['last index of d = '] + (( txt booska-ugu-dambeeya: ['d'] ) - 0), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['txt equals Word Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Word Salad'] ), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['txt equals Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Ceasar Salad'] ), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), sadar-cusub.

